# NOTE: where a .pubignore exists, pub uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore for that
# directory - it does not merge the two. So this file has to repeat everything
# from .gitignore that must stay out of the published archive, not just the
# extra entries. Keep it in sync when .gitignore changes.

